===Forge===
Weapon Speed can be increased further by using an [[Emerald]] at the [[Forge]] up to 3 times, for a maximum of +7 additional speed.

Some tools can similarly be [[Forge#Tool enchantments|enchanted]] using a [[Prismatic Shard]] to be 33% faster.

==[[File:Speed.png|24px|link=]] Player Speed==

'''Player Speed''' refers to how fast the player moves across the world.

The player's base speed is:
* 2 when walking
* 5 when running
* 6.6 when riding a [[Animals#Horse|Horse]] (7 if the horse was fed a [[carrot]] that day)

A variety of positive and negative [[Buffs]] can change the player speed, as detailed under [[#Food and Drink|Food and Drink]], [[#Buffs|Buffs]], and [[#Permanent Buffs|Permanent Buffs]].

Speed is also affected by some [[#Terrain|terrains]], but not when riding a horse.

Although terrain and/or debuffs may decrease a player speed, the speed is never decreased below 1.

